# Eval results — raw JSON is large and machine-generated; track the
# human-readable .report.md summaries produced by `pnpm eval:report --write`.
# A small allowlist of raw JSONs is checked in for each run cited by
# evals/results/MANIFEST.md so reviewers can audit judge traces and re-grade
# pass/fail using current task definitions. When you cite a new run in the
# manifest, also exempt its <prefix>.json here.
evals/results/*.json
!evals/results/.gitkeep
!evals/results/09c45a9e.json
!evals/results/1d3c75ba.json
!evals/results/2e370910.json
!evals/results/3251f5b8.json
!evals/results/341e6044.json
!evals/results/47d48abd.json
!evals/results/517c16c7.json
!evals/results/58d7f3b5.json
!evals/results/5a478eec.json
!evals/results/5aced9d6.json
!evals/results/a345f39c.json
!evals/results/b1b15014.json

